        <h1>Trying new things, <em>learning as I go.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">I study Mathematics at National Cheng Kung University, with interests in combinatorial optimization, graph partitioning, and computer vision. I like exploring ideas through programming and practical experiments, and I also enjoy teaching and community activities.</p>
